                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "239781744",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198098704815",
                            "num_reviews": 1,
                            "playtime_forever": 88,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 88,
                            "playtime_at_review": 88,
                            "last_played": 1794224288
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I feel like I have to be missing something; there's no other way to explain it. \n\nI have every upgrade, I have every prestige unlock (which, btw, don't try to prestige if you already have everything because it'll soft-lock the game), I have 15 of every staff, a v17.999 algorithm, and it only took me just over an hour to get there. \n\nThe game is fast in basically every respect... except for the World Impact bar, which has still barely managed to tick over 55% in all this time. In a game where you can unlock on offer in an hour, an agonizingly slow progress bar just feels like some cheap way to waste player time.\n\nIn the time it took me to write this, it ticked over to 56%. I don't feel like waiting for the other 44%.",
